window.products.push({"id":618018,"name":"Lulu Home Christmas Stocking Holder, Set of 2 Soft Stuffed Christmas Gnome Metal Stocking Hangers, Rustic Farmhouse Christmas Stocking Hooks for Firep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A15QNe+ionL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDES: Christmas stocking holders*2. Each is sized 12.4\" x 5.2\" x 2.9\". The metal hook is fixed on the base and cannot be removed, so you do not need to worry about losing it. ADORABLE STUFFED GNOMES: The standing gnomes are wearing wool caps with classic Christmas patterns, such as snowflakes, and adorned with holy leaf and red berries, which adding great Xmas and holiday touch. The soft cap is well stuffed and beautifully shaped, and at the top is adorned with a small silver bell which will tinkle when move. STABLE STANDING & HOLDING: The sandbags at the bottom of the gnomes and the large and heavy base maintain them good stability while allow them holding the stocking with presents. The felt material at the base bottom can also effectively prevent it from sliding to help it hold things better. Each can hold up to 2.5 pounds. BRING GREAT XMAS GREETINGS: Lulu Home Christmas gnomes are super lovely and they’re known for bringing good lucks. So they’re very suitable to be placed at home as a decoration. It also works well as a gift to be sent to your families or friends, and the receiver can also feel the love and get the blessing. IDEAL CHRISTMAS STOCKING HOLDER: The metal hook can well hang your Christmas stockings with quite good stability. It is great ideal to be placed on mantels, shelves, beside cabinet, stair cases and other flat surface not only as a stocking hanger but also as a Christmas decorative ornaments to add unexpected festive touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A15QNe+ionL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lulu Home","source_asin":"B0BHW5JQM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHW5JQM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHW5JQM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
