window.products.push({"id":618123,"name":"63in. Boxwood Topiary Artificial Tree in Tall White Planter UV Resistant (Indoor/Outdoor)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":220.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aFw8jzJGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Escape to an elegant European summer villa with this perfectly trimmed Boxwood Topiary Artificial Tree – that requires zero maintenance. Always make a great first impression with a medley of lush, glossy leaves manicured in a rectangular shape. Enhance your curb appeal by placing this faux Boxwood Topiary Tree in your back yard, front yard, garden or patio and be transported to an enchanting oasis. Standing at 63\", from a tall white planter (included in height), curate with other topiaries for a cohesive look. We carry boxwood topiaries in larger and smaller sizes. Silk trees are manufactured using synthetic materials, such as polyester material or plastic, and are well designed and constructed to be life-like in appearance. This item will need to be re-shaped when removed from the secure box to allow it to reach its fullest size. Your artificial plant will look beautiful for years to come; simply wipe clean with a soft dry cloth when needed. About Nearly Natural Inc. - For over 75 years, Nearly Natural Inc. has been providing conscientious consumers with beautiful alternatives to natural decorations. Employing and advised by naturalists who understand the live plant world, Nearly Natural is able to recreate the most realistic-looking decorative items for homes, offices, and businesses. Driven by a true commitment to customer service, attention to detail, and natural philosophy, Nearly Natural strives to bring customers the most beautiful, unique, and striking faux plants and floral on the market. Construction materials: Styrofoam, Fiber Clay, Iron Wire, Plastic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aFw8jzJGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nearly Natural","source_asin":"B08TPXKKFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TPXKKFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TPXKKFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
