window.products.push({"id":618138,"name":"CafePress Yorkshire Terrier Mom 2 Tote Bag Natural Canvas Tote Bag, Reusable Shopping Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315zVXthn3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Bag: Make a statement with a fun and functional canvas tote bag that shows off your unique personality. This versatile, multipurpose classic is sure to become your go-to reusable, foldable bag that is perfect for shopping, work, or vacation. Two Sizes: Small tote measures 15\" x 15 x 6\" with 26.5\" handles. Medium tote measures 15\" x 18\" x 6\" with 22\" handles. Each tote size features reinforced handles and full side and bottom support gussets for strength and durability. Professionally Printed: Our tote bags are imported from our trusted partners. Then each tote is expertly printed with sharp and vivid graphics using premium inks by our USA printing partner. Our quality totes are built to last: construction, design and graphic design placement. Easy To Care For Eco-Friendly Carryall Option: No need to use more plastic grocery bags, wasteful wrapping paper or other one time use products. Use for everyday errands, to present gifts, stow away items and organize with our minimalist tote bags. Once our cotton canvas bags become soiled, simply spot clean or place in washing machine on your favorite cold setting. Machine dry on low heat or hang dry. Ideal Everyday Tote or Gift : Treat yourself or surprise family members, friends, colleagues or your favorite teacher. Our beautifully designed cotton canvas tote bags make a unique and thoughtful present for Christmas, Easter, Mother's Day, birthdays, back-to-school, weddings, anniversary and so much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315zVXthn3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B0BHZB5C7T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZB5C7T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZB5C7T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":618139,"name":"S&T INC. Absorbent, Reversible XL Microfiber Dish Drying Mat for Kitchen, 18 Inch x 24 Inch, Teal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aI6-1i21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The S&T dish drying mat is the new solution to the age old tradition of placing dish towels on the counter when hand-washing pots, pans, dishes and glassware. Often imitated, but never duplicated, our dish drying mat features a center layer of foam that is fused to revolutionary, super-absorbent microfiber fabric using our proprietary manufacturing process. This process yields a mat that is highly functional and incredibly durable, use after use, wash after wash. By combining an optimal foam thickness with uniquely woven microfiber fabric, water quickly radiates from the point of contact, enhancing absorption and quickening drying time. You will be amazed by the effectiveness and convenience of this deceptively simple item! the S&T dish drying mat is perfect for use underneath a dish rack to catch drips or you can place pots, pans and glassware directly on the mat. You can even set it under small appliances to protect your counter from scratches and scuffs. Plus, each mat comes with a sewn-in twill corner sash allowing for convenient hanging when drying or storing. Caring for your dish drying mat is easy; simply toss it in the washing machine with cold water and a liquid detergent and then place in the dryer on a low heat setting. The dish drying mat is just one of the many impressive items offered by S&T. Designed to make it easier to take care of the home, our innovative, high-value and superior-quality products provide cleaning, kitchen, bath, laundry and pet solutions to solve life's little dilemmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aI6-1i21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S&T INC.","source_asin":"B071JSF1C5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071JSF1C5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071JSF1C5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
