window.products.push({"id":618348,"name":"Zanzer 11\" Ceramic Soated Copper Griddle Frying Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fS8GUGZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make the perfect breakfast and grill your meats indoors with the Zanzer 11-inch Ceramic Coated Copper Griddle. Hot temperatures and summer thunderstorms may cause you to refrain from cooking on the barbecue in those late summer months. The griddle is oven and broiler safe , capable of withstanding temperatures up to 500°F so can cook indoors and have that same great taste . This ceramic griddle is crafted using aluminum , making it lightweight and easy to handle yet sturdy to endure daily use year after year. It features an attractive, copper-colored finish that will brighten up any kitchen, outfitted with a stainless steel handle to complete the stylish look and allow you to confidently carry your cookware. PFOA and PTFE free to ensure a safe eating experience, the eco-friendly griddle features a ceramic, non-stick coating which makes cooking an effortless task. This scratch-resistant surface allows you to prepare and cook all your favorite meals without food sticking to the surface or worrying about it not being safe to eat. You can fit large food quantities inside this 11-inch square griddle , letting you cook for your entire family at once. Additionally, the 3-millimeter, stainless steel induction plate on the bottom allows for fast, even cooking without hot spots , retaining heat for longer periods of time. A great addition to your cookware , this griddle is perfect for making bacon and eggs, pancakes and sausage, and other breakfast items. Ridges allow you to perfectly grill your food on the stovetop , making it ideal for also cooking burgers, steaks, chicken, fish and veggies. No matter what you cook, the food slides off with ease and cleanup is a breeze .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fS8GUGZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zanzer","source_asin":"B07B9QVP2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B9QVP2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B9QVP2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
