window.products.push({"id":618375,"name":"Camping Fan - 23000mAh, LED Lantern, Stepless Speed, 360°Head Rotation, 4 Light & 7 Timing Modes, Rechargeable Battery Operated Fan, Personal USB Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FQBrvfFsL._AC_.jpg","description":"☞【23000mAh Capacity Battery】Powered by rechargeable 23000mAh batteries(built-in), it can work continuously for 9-200 hours depending on speeds.There are 4 indicators that display the remaining power and remind you to charge it in a timely manner. You can charge your phone or computer at the same time, don't need to bring a backup battery when camping outdoors. ☞【Stepless Speed Regulation】OGORI camping fan has a stepless speed regulation function that is different from others. Its speed can up to 2600 RPM, fasts fresh the surrounding air. It works very quiet, the max volume is 30db. You can choose any wind speed that makes you feel comfortable, bringing a better experience to your camping life! ☞【Clip & 360°rotation】 Portable camping fan is made of high-quality ABS+PC material, with a wide and sturdy base that can prevent overturning and is very durable. It's equipped with a clip at the bottom, which can be used in multiple scenarios: can be placed on a table, grass, sandwiched on a tent, iron frame, or hammock. It can rotate 360 ° horizontally and can be manually shaken 45 ° back and forth, providing comfortable cold air from any angle. ☞【Super Bright LED Camping Lantern】OGORI camping fan has 4 levels of adjustable brightness and can last up to 200 hours of illumination. It can provide soft and non dazzling light to protect your eyesight, it’s an ideal light source for night camping or hiking. ☞【Timing & Camera Holder Function】The timing function allows you to have a more comfortable sleep environment, with 1-7 hours to choose from. Use the control knob to adjust the wind speed you need, providing a good cool airflow for the bedroom. With the camera holder function, it provides more options for your use. This could be a great gift for family and friends this summer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FQBrvfFsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OGORI","source_asin":"B0C3HQBF1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3HQBF1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3HQBF1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
