window.products.push({"id":618406,"name":"King International Stainless Steel Food Grade Bento Vintage Belly Tiffin Box, Traditional Indian Lunch Box, Indian Tiffin, Food storage container (4 t","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Mi9sAio3L._AC_.jpg","description":"This uniquely shaped Tiffin comprises of 4 Equal with stomach out layers each gradually tapering inwards to form a belly shape when assembled. Multiple size containers are useful to carry food of various quantities. All 4 layers and lids are held firmly together by the separate clamping mechanism and it’s perfect for all carrying lunch while travelling as this stainless steel product will keep your food hot for long. It has exotic silver shining and it’s Easy to clean. This is ideal Tiffin for everyone. Made from 100% Stainless Steel making them highly durable and resistance to corrosion. We have this tiffin available in different colour options as well. Dimensions of complete tiffin: 12.4 x 12.4 x 24.5cm Dimension of Tier-1 (top) : 13 x 13 x 5.5cm Dimension of Tier-2 : 13 x 13 x 5.5cm Dimension of Tier-3: 13 x13 x 5.5cm Dimension of Tier-4 (bottom): 13 x 13 x 5.5 Weight of complete Tiffin: 550gm Capacity of complete Tiffin: 2200ml Capacity of Tier-1 (top): 550 ml Capacity of Tier-2: 550 ml Capacity of Tier-3: 550 ml Capacity of Tier-4 (bottom): 550 ml","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Mi9sAio3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"King International","source_asin":"B01MTKJSRU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTKJSRU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MTKJSRU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":618407,"name":"Mozaik Premium Plastic 128 oz. All-in-One Serving Bowl Set with Lid, Serving Utensils and Plates, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S+K9vFfuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Entertaining friends and family is a lot of fun, but when the last guest walks out the door, there’s usually an overwhelming pile of dirty dishes and wine glasses. But paper plates aren’t always sturdy, plastic cutlery can be flimsy, and while you wouldn’t want your guests sipping a delicious vintage from a red plastic cup, you also don’t want your favorite wine glasses getting broken during a particularly rowdy game of charades. Mozaik Premium Plastic Tableware offers the same versatility and convenience of ordinary disposable paper goods, but with more durability and the elevated look and feel of real plates, silverware, and glasses. Whether it’s the holidays, a birthday party, or simply a weeknight dinner with the family, you can serve a stress-free meal that feels more put together than paper plates and napkins, but doesn’t require an hour of washing dishes. Mozaik also offers a full assortment of plates, serving bowls, platters, and utensils, as well as appetizer and dessert sets that are perfect for tastings and special events. BPA-free and Kosher-Parve certified, every Mozaik piece comes with the added bonus of recyclability OR reusability – when your event is over, simply recycle your used dishes and drinkware, or hand wash them and store them for your next dinner party, event, or barbecue. There’s no need to dread post-party cleanup again – you’ll spend less time in the kitchen and more time enjoying your guests (and food!). Planning a picnic or going to a barbecue? The Mozaik Premium Plastic 128 oz. All-in-One Serving Bowl Set with Lid, Serving Utensils and Plates is an elevated and perfectly portable way to pack a healthy quinoa salad, sliced berries, or even a batch of your grandmother’s famous fried chicken. The serving bowl comes with eight (8) premium plastic 6.5” white square plates and two (2) serving utensils that can be joined together to create a pair of serving tongs. The plates and serving utensils both conveniently snap right into the lid, making the bowl easy to transport and store when it’s not in use. The bowl itself is heavy duty and can withstand temperatures up to 220º, so it can be used for both hot and cold entreés or sides, plus it has rounded corners that can be used as a spout for pouring dressings or sauces. Easily share pasta, potatoes, or your favorite dessert at tailgates or outdoor concerts without the mess of plastic wrap and paper plates. The bowl, lid, utensils, and plates can all be recycled, or washed for your next event – either handwash, or place in the top rack of your dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S+K9vFfuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mozaik","source_asin":"B07DMJ2HRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DMJ2HRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DMJ2HRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
