window.products.push({"id":618590,"name":"MACKENZIE-CHILDS Courtly Check Enamel Appetizer Plates, Small Dessert Plates and Tapas Plates, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":108.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JVGcv3tfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It doesn’t get more classic than Courtly Check. The MacKenzie-Childs Courtly Check Enamel Appetizer Plates are the perfect addition to your tableware collection. This plate set offers a slightly smaller silhouette and features the warm, inviting high-contrast gloss of our most popular pattern. The comfort food of dinnerware, our Courtly Check pattern is casual and cozy with a subtle jewel-toned palette woven by an artisan’s brush through the glossy hand-painted checks. These picturesque appetizer and dessert plates perfectly match the other kitchen tools and dishware in our Courtly Check collection, including tea kettles, full-size dinner plates, cups, serving dishes, and more!You’ll never have to guess what to get for a housewarming gift now that you’re a part of the MacKenzie-Childs family. Our artisan-designed enamel pitchers and kitchenware pieces are the perfect gifts for any special people in your life. Since 1983, our talented designers and artisans have created beautiful original tableware, furniture, home and garden accessories, and more that add joy and grace to homes great and small throughout the world.Care instructions: Dishwasher-safe. For best results, hand-wash with mild soap and dry immediately. Do not microwave. Materials: Hand-glazed heavy-gauge steel underbody with hand-painted Courtly Checks rimmed in bronzed stainless steel. Pieces may vary due to the handmade nature of each product. Imported. Our enamelware exceeds both federal food-safety regulations and California’s Proposition 65, the strictest environmental safety standards in the United States. Handle enamelware with care and discontinue use for food service if it becomes chipped, cracked, or broken. Dimensions: 5\" dia.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JVGcv3tfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MACKENZIE-CHILDS","source_asin":"B014G3OSOU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014G3OSOU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014G3OSOU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
