window.products.push({"id":618728,"name":"JR William Modern Coasters Set, Modern Home Decor Crystal Clear Acrylic & Soho Black Acrylic Coasters for Drinks - Square Acrylic Coaster Set of 4 in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vp5EUaHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleek beauty with simple elegance, these coasters enhance any décor. Cocktails in the living room or drinks in your kitchen, these coasters are perfect for any occasion. JR William coasters cleverly walk the line between chic and shield. Firstly, Lucite, Perspex and Plexiglass are all trade names for Acrylic and so if you find a \"Lucite\" Cleaner, it will work for all Acrylic products as well. We recommend using a microfiber cleaning cloth and a small amount of warm water for regular maintenance. If a problem persists, we use Novus Polish 1 for clean and shine, Novus Polish 2 for Small Scratches and Novus Polish 3 for Heavy Scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vp5EUaHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JR William","source_asin":"B071JS9JKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071JS9JKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071JS9JKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
