window.products.push({"id":618751,"name":"Toile de jouy Christmas Balls,5 Units/Pack,one of its Kind,high-end,Haute Couture Decor, Vintage Versailles Luxury,Capture in Details,in Scenes, Bucol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QqxuqMBXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Toile de Jouy, monochromatic patterns have been the classic decorating choice for almost 250 years, while being the shortcut to high-end chic French Interiors. Ever since Marie-Antoinette, the empress Josephine and her husband Napoleon, selected the print for their palaces and stately homes, it has remained an aesthetic sensation not only for aristocratic houses but as the fundamentals of the biggest brands in Haute Couture, Pick up a fashion magazine, Interior decorating publication, you will not miss seeing toile prints in almost protean profusion. Always in fine and expensive products like wallpapers and famous designers' collections and clothes.To attest to the brilliance and timeless character of this print,a wider number of accessories providers have been embellishing their products with those ever-reinterpreted impressions. Yet nobody has ever brought in those venerable bucolic scenes on a Christmas ornament, taking balls, and ribbons as a canvas. This is totally unseen.We can therefore rightfully say that we are pioneering the use of Toile print in festive ornaments. With our toile printed balls your tree, Door welcoming wreath,will have this sense of understated luxury,History,culture, and high fashion, proper to a shabby chic french cottage","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QqxuqMBXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toile de Joie","source_asin":"B08KFK1L5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KFK1L5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KFK1L5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
