window.products.push({"id":618765,"name":"Chefman XL 7 Qt. Slow Cooker, All-Natural, Glaze & Chemical-Free Pot, Stovetop or Oven Cooking, Dishwasher Safe Crock; Naturally Nonstick & Paleo-Frie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l97ofXHIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Chefman All Natural Slow Cooker keeps up with your busy, on-the-go lifestyle. Turn the dial to 'High' and get a hot meal, snack, appetizer or dip in no time. Set it on 'Low' and tonight's dinner can cook while you are at work. Or use the 'Warm' setting during a get together with friends so your dish stays ready to eat until the party is over. No matter the recipe or the occasion, your Chefman Slow Cooker keeps the temperature steady so your food is cooked to perfection, full of flavor and delicious.The Chefman All Natural Slow Cooker is the only Naturally Nonstick Paleo Certified Slow Cooker, and with a sleek black finish, it looks at home in any kitchen. The all-natural 5 Qt., 6 Qt and 7 Qt. glaze free, chemical-free stovetop, oven, dishwasher safe crock, transfers easily from the frame to the table or refrigerator. Both the stoneware and the glass lid are dishwasher-safe, making clean-up simple. The Chefman All Natural Slow Cooker makes cooking easy For the entire family.Using Stoneware safely: The advantage to stoneware is the even-cooking, non-burning surface it provides. Fill as much of the surface with food as possible before cooking to take full advantage of this effect. A sudden change in temperature can cause the stoneware to crack. To avoid thermal shock (fast temperature shift) allow the pan to cool down before it goes into the freezer, refrigerator, or under cold water for cleaning.It is recommended to wait until the pan is at room temperature, after taking it out of the freezer, and before placing it in the oven or microwave.Thaw frozen foods before cooking them in stoneware to prevent cracks from forming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l97ofXHIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B071FBQHZ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071FBQHZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071FBQHZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
