window.products.push({"id":618774,"name":"Home Soft Things Citraka Soft Warm Cozy Fluffy Comfy Throw Blanket with Sherpa Backing, Black, 50'' x 60'', Luxurious Accent Plush Couch Bed Sofa Cove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHybh1KqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXPERIENCE LUXURY AT ITS FINEST: Ultra Soft Luxury Faux Fur That's Tangible, Stylish and Practical. Snuggle, Cuddle and Bundle Up With This Functional Piece of Art That's Sure Be A Conversation Starter. Citraka, in the Indian Sanskrit language, means painted or spotted making for an attractive name for this throw. CHARMING SHERPA BACKING: Thick polyester fabric backing is made to resemble sheep skin that locks in heat creating a warm, alluring environment on a frosty day. Sherpa blankets derive their inspiration and name from the indigenous Sherpa people of the Himalayan mountains which means you can depend on this beauty to keep the cold out. MULTI-PURPOSE USE: Elegantly drape over your favorite chaise lounge, couch, chair, window seat or bed for an expressive touch to your home decor. GIVE THE GIFT OF SOPHISTICATION: Throw comes wrapped in a lovely satin ribbon then tied in a bow for easy gift giving. SIZES AND COLORS: Available in 50\" x 60\" AND 60\" x 80\". Black and Brown EASY CARE: Machine wash cold on delicate cycle. Tumble dry on lowest heat as Sherpa easily becomes matted and rough when exposed to high heat. Best results Dry Clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHybh1KqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Soft Things","source_asin":"B07NFRCH66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NFRCH66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NFRCH66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
