window.products.push({"id":618972,"name":"Brass Essential Oil Burner and Wax Tart Warmer | Geometric Metal Tealight Holder with Brass Bowl | Home Decorations Candle Tea Light Holder for Medita","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CiEjRybUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brass Oil Diffuser Simple and Sober Brass Oil Diffuser generates warm candlelight and a great aroma. Just need to set a tea light candle in a candle holder, light it, and add your favorite fragrance oil to the small bowl on top of the burner. When oil gets warms, the pleasant smell and the soft candlelight pattern will relax your mind and body with positivity. The natural stone warmer is Matt finished, gives you a contemporary feel. Steps to use brass oil diffuser with OIL/WATER : Step 1: Put tablespoon water i.e  5 - 10 drops  of the oil into the bowl Step 2: Put a candle into the bowl. Step 3: Let the tea light warm the oil/water mixture to spread fragrance. *Note: Tea lights usually burn out in 2.5 hours. Oil/water mixture may run out in 2 hours. You may need to add some oil & water when using. Steps to use stone oil diffuser with WAX : Step 1: Put wax of the appropriate size in the bowl which is on the top of the burner. Step 2: Put a candle into the bowl. Step 3: Let the tea light warms the wax and with time, it will start spreading the fragrance. *Note: Tea lights usually burn out in 2.5 hours. Wax may run out in 2-3 hours. You may need to add some more wax while using. Please do not add the wax greater than the size of a bowl which may lead it to spread out from the bowl.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CiEjRybUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancient Handicraft","source_asin":"B08F1GSPHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-618972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F1GSPHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F1GSPHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
